   "actionTime": "17:47:00",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House rose from the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union to report H.R. 5.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1993-06-15",
   "actionTime": "16:45:10",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 195, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 30 minutes of debate on the Ridge amendment in the nature of a substitute.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1993-06-15",
   "actionTime": "15:48:37",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 5, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with 30 minutes of debate on the Edwards of Texas amendment.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1993-06-15",
   "actionTime": "13:22:26",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "GENERAL DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H.R. 5, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with two hours of general debate.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32400",
   "actionDate": "1993-06-15",
   "actionTime": "13:22:07",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The Speaker designated the Honorable Sander M. Levin to act as Chairman of the Committee.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32020",
   "actionDate": "1993-06-15",
   "actionTime": "13:22:04",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "House resolved itself into the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union pursuant to H. Res. 195 and Rule XXIII.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1993-06-15",
   "actionTime": "13:21:53",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 5 with 2 hours of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit. Upon adoption of this resolution the Speaker may declare the House resolved into the Committee of the Whole for consideration of the bill. Sixty minutes of the two hours of general debate shall be controlled by the Chairman and Ranking Member of the Committee on Education and Labor, thirty minutes controlled by the chairman and ranking member of the Committee on Energy and Commerce, and thirty minutes controlled by the chairman and ranking member of the Committee on Public Works and Transportaiton. Specified amendments are in order. The amendments recommended by the Committee on Education and Labor now printed in the bill shall be considered as adopted in the House and in the Committee of the Whole. No other amendents shall",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "1993-06-15",
   "actionTime": "13:21:48",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 195. (consideration: CR H3527-3568)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L220",
   "actionDate": "1993-06-15",
   "actionTime": "13:21:41",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule H. Res. 195 passed House.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
